[{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b003:l035","ordinal":293121,"en":"May warrior Kyyaz not be heading into a pit;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b003:l036","ordinal":293122,"en":"May the dear man who never turned back"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b003:l037","ordinal":293123,"en":"Not be marching into captivity."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b003:l038","ordinal":293124,"en":"May his wedding not become a massacre;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b003:l039","ordinal":293125,"en":"May the teeming Chinese, hearing of it,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l001","ordinal":293126,"en":"Not break his host and slaughter them,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l002","ordinal":293127,"en":"Bring disaster upon his camp,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l003","ordinal":293128,"en":"And openly destroy the people."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l004","ordinal":293129,"en":"If he takes the wife of Manas’s son,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l005","ordinal":293130,"en":"The blood-shedding hero, let him take her himself;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l006","ordinal":293131,"en":"May the khan’s fury not unleash an uproar,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l007","ordinal":293132,"en":"And may a people like the Jediger survive."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l008","ordinal":293133,"en":"May the wedding not become a bloody conflict"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l009","ordinal":293134,"en":"That sets them marching to war."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l010","ordinal":293135,"en":"May the Jediger not wake tomorrow"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l011","ordinal":293136,"en":"Bereft of warrior Kyyaz,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l012","ordinal":293137,"en":"And find themselves taken captive.”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l013","ordinal":293138,"en":"Buzumbek Khan of ruined Chambyl"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l014","ordinal":293139,"en":"Spoke these words;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l015","ordinal":293140,"en":"To the muttering khans"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l016","ordinal":293141,"en":"He voiced the thoughts in his heart,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l017","ordinal":293142,"en":"Opposing the wedding."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l018","ordinal":293143,"en":"Amid the assembled people,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l019","ordinal":293144,"en":"He explained what lay ahead."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l020","ordinal":293145,"en":"“If what you say is true,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l021","ordinal":293146,"en":"May the wedding become a massacre;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l022","ordinal":293147,"en":"May that wretch Kyyaz"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l023","ordinal":293148,"en":"Meet his death this very day;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l024","ordinal":293149,"en":"May livestock and people alike be struck down,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l025","ordinal":293150,"en":"And may it end just so.”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l026","ordinal":293151,"en":"Many khans who heard these words"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l027","ordinal":293152,"en":"Now returned to their own lands,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l028","ordinal":293153,"en":"Spitting wherever they went"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l029","ordinal":293154,"en":"And scattering bitter curses."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l030","ordinal":293155,"en":"Everyone who understood"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l031","ordinal":293156,"en":"Set off for his own country."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l032","ordinal":293157,"en":"Rejecting in their hearts"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l033","ordinal":293158,"en":"The feast held by the khan,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l034","ordinal":293159,"en":"The khans refused to come;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l035","ordinal":293160,"en":"Cursing and rebuking him,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l036","ordinal":293161,"en":"They returned to their own lands."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l037","ordinal":293162,"en":"Among the Jediger of Jeti-Özön,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l038","ordinal":293163,"en":"They said deadly poison,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1395:b005:l039","ordinal":293164,"en":"Fatal to anyone who drank it, had been mixed in;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l001","ordinal":293165,"en":"Because he had seized the hero’s wife,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l002","ordinal":293166,"en":"Warrior Kyyaz alone gained fame,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l003","ordinal":293167,"en":"While the indignant Jediger"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l004","ordinal":293168,"en":"Were left to bear the quarrel."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l005","ordinal":293169,"en":"The noble, ill-fated woman"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l006","ordinal":293170,"en":"Was Chürök, daughter of Akun;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l007","ordinal":293171,"en":"She was no mere Chürök, but a dark hour,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l008","ordinal":293172,"en":"A black calamity and disaster."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l009","ordinal":293173,"en":"She was the very source of consuming fire,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l010","ordinal":293174,"en":"The dark eye of affliction."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l011","ordinal":293175,"en":"Aichürök was calamity itself,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l012","ordinal":293176,"en":"The dark eye of turmoil."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l013","ordinal":293177,"en":"Though taken as spoil and wed by force,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l014","ordinal":293178,"en":"Chürök would not lose heart."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l015","ordinal":293179,"en":"While Chürök’s eyes remained open,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l016","ordinal":293180,"en":"The Jediger’s undertaking would not prosper."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l017","ordinal":293181,"en":"That noble, formidable woman,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l018","ordinal":293182,"en":"Renowned Chürök, would not vanish."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l019","ordinal":293183,"en":"If you wronged Aichürök too greatly,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l020","ordinal":293184,"en":"She would strip the flesh from a horse’s neck;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l021","ordinal":293185,"en":"Flying through the air,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l022","ordinal":293186,"en":"She would travel the whole world."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l023","ordinal":293187,"en":"If she flew away, she would become a swan,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l024","ordinal":293188,"en":"And uproar would break out among the Jediger."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l025","ordinal":293189,"en":"If Aichürök gathered her wits,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l026","ordinal":293190,"en":"Destruction would come from her."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l027","ordinal":293191,"en":"Wait and see, if she survives,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l028","ordinal":293192,"en":"Strife will arise from warrior Kyyaz."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l029","ordinal":293193,"en":"Chürök is a woman taken as spoil,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l030","ordinal":293194,"en":"Yet she is no mere woman but calamity."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l031","ordinal":293195,"en":"While Chürök and Kyyaz live,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l032","ordinal":293196,"en":"If Aichürök becomes enraged,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l033","ordinal":293197,"en":"She will be the Jediger’s demon."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l034","ordinal":293198,"en":"If she suddenly grows excited,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l035","ordinal":293199,"en":"If she suddenly takes flight,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l036","ordinal":293200,"en":"She will be the Jediger’s demon.”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l037","ordinal":293201,"en":"The people who had come spoke in an uproar"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l038","ordinal":293202,"en":"And returned to their own lands."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b003:l039","ordinal":293203,"en":"The great host of khans departed;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l001","ordinal":293204,"en":"Many souls grieved."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l002","ordinal":293205,"en":"One urged another onward from behind:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l003","ordinal":293206,"en":"“Go, for conflict will arise"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l004","ordinal":293207,"en":"From Aichürök’s suffering.”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l005","ordinal":293208,"en":"The great people clamored, saying this,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l006","ordinal":293209,"en":"Speaking of such ominous wonders."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l007","ordinal":293210,"en":"Let us leave that matter there;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l008","ordinal":293211,"en":"Of the great people in Jeti-Özön,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l009","ordinal":293212,"en":"Let us begin the news of the nation."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l010","ordinal":293213,"en":"Of warrior Kyyaz among the people,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l011","ordinal":293214,"en":"Let us begin the tale of the lion."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l012","ordinal":293215,"en":"When word came of Kyyaz’s command,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l013","ordinal":293216,"en":"The restless Jediger"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l014","ordinal":293217,"en":"Gathered as a nation and filled the land;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l015","ordinal":293218,"en":"By Almighty Allah’s will,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l016","ordinal":293219,"en":"So many souls assembled."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l017","ordinal":293220,"en":"Their old men came crawling,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l018","ordinal":293221,"en":"Their children came tumbling,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l019","ordinal":293222,"en":"And all arrived in throngs."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l020","ordinal":293223,"en":"The Jediger people beheld"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l021","ordinal":293224,"en":"A vast feast that split the sky."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l022","ordinal":293225,"en":"At the royal palace,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l023","ordinal":293226,"en":"In the courtyard built for a khan,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l024","ordinal":293227,"en":"One that surpassed all others in the land,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l025","ordinal":293228,"en":"At Aichürök’s pavilion,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l026","ordinal":293229,"en":"For the proud, fierce woman,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l027","ordinal":293230,"en":"Rubies and precious stones"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l028","ordinal":293231,"en":"Had been set in alternating rows."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l029","ordinal":293232,"en":"A jewel as large as a horse’s head"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l030","ordinal":293233,"en":"Had been set with ceremony"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l031","ordinal":293234,"en":"In the eye of the yurt’s crown-ring."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l032","ordinal":293235,"en":"Golden nails were driven in;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l033","ordinal":293236,"en":"Letters and figures were traced in gold"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l034","ordinal":293237,"en":"Around the lattice walls."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l035","ordinal":293238,"en":"In making this royal yurt,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l036","ordinal":293239,"en":"Much of the blood-shedding khan’s treasure"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l037","ordinal":293240,"en":"Had plainly been spent."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l038","ordinal":293241,"en":"Poor Aichürök’s royal yurt,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1396:b004:l039","ordinal":293242,"en":"While the gray-maned hero was alive,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l001","ordinal":293243,"en":"Was folded away for the winter;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l002","ordinal":293244,"en":"When the days of summer came,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l003","ordinal":293245,"en":"It was pitched for excursions"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l004","ordinal":293246,"en":"Upon the blue-mottled field."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l005","ordinal":293247,"en":"Its threshold, fashioned from ruby,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l006","ordinal":293248,"en":"Was beautifully formed;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l007","ordinal":293249,"en":"Merely to behold it"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l008","ordinal":293250,"en":"Satisfied the human heart."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l009","ordinal":293251,"en":"The canopy of that ill-omened pavilion"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l010","ordinal":293252,"en":"Had a brocaded crown,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l011","ordinal":293253,"en":"And that wondrous pavilion"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l012","ordinal":293254,"en":"Was embroidered all around."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l013","ordinal":293255,"en":"Silver wire was wound"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l014","ordinal":293256,"en":"Through the eyes of its lattice walls;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l015","ordinal":293257,"en":"The ends of the roof poles"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l016","ordinal":293258,"en":"Were ceremonially bound"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l017","ordinal":293259,"en":"With gold."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l018","ordinal":293260,"en":"Every eye of the lattice wall"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l019","ordinal":293261,"en":"Had marvelous nails like polished vessels."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l020","ordinal":293262,"en":"All the people and khans assembled"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l021","ordinal":293263,"en":"Seemed to stand gazing at the splendor."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l022","ordinal":293264,"en":"Among the Jediger of Jeti-Özön,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l023","ordinal":293265,"en":"All the bearded elders,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l024","ordinal":293266,"en":"Those who picked up distant news,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l025","ordinal":293267,"en":"The aged slaves who had lived long,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l026","ordinal":293268,"en":"The jesters who made many laugh,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l027","ordinal":293269,"en":"The yellow-haired bearers of hearsay—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l028","ordinal":293270,"en":"All the Jediger,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l029","ordinal":293271,"en":"Men who cultivated wisdom,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l030","ordinal":293272,"en":"Champions quick to devise a way,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l031","ordinal":293273,"en":"Within that royal yurt"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l032","ordinal":293274,"en":"Gazed in astonishment as a great crowd;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l033","ordinal":293275,"en":"Young and old craned forward to look."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l034","ordinal":293276,"en":"Some listened to tales"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l035","ordinal":293277,"en":"Of bygone times and precious deeds."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l036","ordinal":293278,"en":"Some judged formidable Chürök,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l037","ordinal":293279,"en":"Saying she was an extraordinary woman."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l038","ordinal":293280,"en":"Some rejoiced at seeing Aichürök"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b003:l039","ordinal":293281,"en":"And delighted in the sight."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l001","ordinal":293282,"en":"Some, astonished by Aichürök,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l002","ordinal":293283,"en":"Cut their own hands"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l003","ordinal":293284,"en":"Instead of slicing the meat;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l004","ordinal":293285,"en":"Black blood flowed from their hands,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l005","ordinal":293286,"en":"And some withered in pain."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l006","ordinal":293287,"en":"At the sight of Aichürök,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l007","ordinal":293288,"en":"Their souls leapt with joy;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l008","ordinal":293289,"en":"The wrestlers who cut their hands"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l009","ordinal":293290,"en":"Had blood pouring from their sleeves."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l010","ordinal":293291,"en":"Their eyes shone and blazed;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l011","ordinal":293292,"en":"“She is a woman unlike any other,” they said,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l012","ordinal":293293,"en":"And bit their fingers in amazement."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l013","ordinal":293294,"en":"“She has reached the utmost beauty"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l014","ordinal":293295,"en":"And perfect grace,” they said."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l015","ordinal":293296,"en":"“She is a woman who has brought"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l016","ordinal":293297,"en":"Great trouble among the people,” they said."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l017","ordinal":293298,"en":"“With a face radiant as the moon,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l018","ordinal":293299,"en":"She is Lady Chürök,” they said."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l019","ordinal":293300,"en":"“She is a woman of calamity"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l020","ordinal":293301,"en":"Who has stirred strife throughout the world.”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l021","ordinal":293302,"en":"The assembled Jediger craned to see;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l022","ordinal":293303,"en":"Astounded by the graceful bearing"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l023","ordinal":293304,"en":"Of the unfortunate woman,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l024","ordinal":293305,"en":"The great host of black-clad Jediger"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l025","ordinal":293306,"en":"Stood gazing and trembling."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l026","ordinal":293307,"en":"“So this is the woman,” they said,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l027","ordinal":293308,"en":"Marveling one by one."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l028","ordinal":293309,"en":"Brave young men of courage"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l029","ordinal":293310,"en":"Stared until their eyes ached;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l030","ordinal":293311,"en":"Some stumbled and fell,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l031","ordinal":293312,"en":"And some seemed struck down."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l032","ordinal":293313,"en":"They stood shoulder to shoulder, craning to look;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l033","ordinal":293314,"en":"Able youths and promising sons"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l034","ordinal":293315,"en":"Gazed admiringly at your sister-in-law."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l035","ordinal":293316,"en":"Good heavens, souls are fashioned in every way!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l036","ordinal":293317,"en":"Everyone who beheld"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l037","ordinal":293318,"en":"That poor, fierce woman"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l038","ordinal":293319,"en":"Was struck with wonder."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1397:b004:l039","ordinal":293320,"en":"Among black-bearded men,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l001","ordinal":293321,"en":"Some of the people who stood watching"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l002","ordinal":293322,"en":"Felt their beards grow thin."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l003","ordinal":293323,"en":"“If only that radiant, unfortunate woman"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l004","ordinal":293324,"en":"Were my wife,” they thought;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l005","ordinal":293325,"en":"The boldest young men"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l006","ordinal":293326,"en":"Let their saliva run."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l007","ordinal":293327,"en":"They marveled at the sight of Chürök:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l008","ordinal":293328,"en":"“Among all human beings ever created,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l009","ordinal":293329,"en":"She is the radiant Night of Power;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l010","ordinal":293330,"en":"That shining, ill-fated woman"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l011","ordinal":293331,"en":"Is a noble princess reduced to bondage."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l012","ordinal":293332,"en":"Her waist is slender as a scabbard, her face like the moon—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l013","ordinal":293333,"en":"How renowned she is throughout the world!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l014","ordinal":293334,"en":"Apple-necked, with an argali’s breast,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l015","ordinal":293335,"en":"Her wide-set eyes surpass those of any mortal."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l016","ordinal":293336,"en":"With broad hips and long tasseled braids,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l017","ordinal":293337,"en":"She has beautifully wide-set eyes."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l018","ordinal":293338,"en":"In a crimson coat, with a crescent waist,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l019","ordinal":293339,"en":"That graceful beauty"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l020","ordinal":293340,"en":"Is the wondrous one left among the people."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l021","ordinal":293341,"en":"That the great host was slaughtered"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l022","ordinal":293342,"en":"Is no lie but the truth;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l023","ordinal":293343,"en":"She herself is the renowned beauty."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l024","ordinal":293344,"en":"No ordinary mortal could produce such a soul;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l025","ordinal":293345,"en":"Her eyes are those of a noble princess."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l026","ordinal":293346,"en":"When one looks, her face shines;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l027","ordinal":293347,"en":"Her complexion changes and glows."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l028","ordinal":293348,"en":"When she eats and drinks, the food"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l029","ordinal":293349,"en":"Can be seen passing down her throat."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l030","ordinal":293350,"en":"Her supple body stirs like soft leather,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l031","ordinal":293351,"en":"And her face flashes like the sun;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l032","ordinal":293352,"en":"She speaks softly, glowing warmly."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l033","ordinal":293353,"en":"Golden buttons and forty fasteners"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l034","ordinal":293354,"en":"Dangle and chime"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l035","ordinal":293355,"en":"At the cuffs of her sleeves."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l036","ordinal":293356,"en":"Judging the unfortunate woman,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l037","ordinal":293357,"en":"Her whole figure is beauty itself."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l038","ordinal":293358,"en":"The black hair braided down her back"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b003:l039","ordinal":293359,"en":"Is thick as a wrist.”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l001","ordinal":293360,"en":"Of radiant Chürök they said:"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l002","ordinal":293361,"en":"“She is no mere Chürök; this woman"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l003","ordinal":293362,"en":"Is a calamity who has thrown the people into turmoil.”"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l004","ordinal":293363,"en":"She smiled brightly,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l005","ordinal":293364,"en":"Her white teeth gleaming like shovels."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l006","ordinal":293365,"en":"With a thimble mouth and camel-calf eyes,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l007","ordinal":293366,"en":"In a crimson dress, with a crescent waist—"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l008","ordinal":293367,"en":"Alas, the graceful, ill-fated woman!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l009","ordinal":293368,"en":"When one looked, she stood apart in dignity;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l010","ordinal":293369,"en":"Every movement of Chürök"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l011","ordinal":293370,"en":"Seemed bathed in moonlight."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l012","ordinal":293371,"en":"Her glowing white brow"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l013","ordinal":293372,"en":"Satisfied every watching eye."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l014","ordinal":293373,"en":"She was slow to turn away;"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l015","ordinal":293374,"en":"Longing to see Chürök,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l016","ordinal":293375,"en":"Not only Kyyaz but all the Jediger"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1398:b004:l017","ordinal":293376,"en":"Stared with doubled eyes."}]
